From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: IamMaxim <g.maxim.stepanoff@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 30 May 2026 19:01:30 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] strip: remove Zed sign-in / AI-signup / trial from onboarding

Strips the Zed-account surface from the onboarding flow: the SignIn and
OpenAccount actions + handlers, the "Zed Agent" onboarding button
(sign-in / Start Free Trial / zed.dev account), and the dead plan/
agent-state locals that fed the removed first-open telemetry event. The
third-party agent-setup grid (claude-acp, codex-acp, copilot-cli, cursor)
and the rest of onboarding (theme, keymap, vim, import, basics) are kept.
UserStore/Plan/Client/zed_urls drop out of the onboarding crate entirely.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 crates/onboarding/src/basics_page.rs | 84 ++--------------------------
 crates/onboarding/src/onboarding.rs  | 64 +--------------------
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 142 deletions(-)

